      category: "guides",
      content: '<div class="not-content my-6">\n  <ComponentPreview client:load component="dialog" variant="lg" />\n</div>\n\n## \uACC4\uC57D\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <SpecRenderer client:load component="dialog" />\n</div>\n\n\n## \uD1A0\uD070\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <TokenInspector client:load component="dialog" />\n</div>\n\n## \uC124\uCE58\n\n<PackageInstall />\n\n## \uC0AC\uC6A9\uBC95\n\n```tsx\n<Dialog>\n  <DialogTrigger asChild>\n    <Button>Open Dialog</Button>\n  </DialogTrigger>\n  <DialogContent>\n    <DialogHeader>\n      <DialogTitle>Confirm Action</DialogTitle>\n      <DialogDescription>\n        Are you sure you want to continue?\n      </DialogDescription>\n    </DialogHeader>\n    <DialogClose asChild>\n      <Button>Cancel</Button>\n    </DialogClose>\n  </DialogContent>\n</Dialog>\n\n<Dialog size="sm" open={isOpen} onOpenChange={setIsOpen}>\n  <DialogContent scrollable={false}>\n    {/* Content with custom scroll handling */}\n  </DialogContent>\n</Dialog>\n```\n\n\uACC4\uC57D \uC18C\uC2A4: `packages/react/spec/components/dialog.json` \u2014 \uC704\uC758 SpecRenderer\uB85C \uB80C\uB354\uB9C1\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.',
      searchText: 'dialog \uC911\uC694\uD55C \uC791\uC5C5\uC744 \uC704\uD55C \uBAA8\uB2EC \uB2E4\uC774\uC5BC\uB85C\uADF8 \uC624\uBC84\uB808\uC774. \n<div class="not-content my-6">\n  <componentpreview client:load component="dialog" variant="lg" />\n</div>\n\n## \uACC4\uC57D\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <specrenderer client:load component="dialog" />\n</div>\n\n\n## \uD1A0\uD070\n\n<div class="not-content">\n  <tokeninspector client:load component="dialog" />\n</div>\n\n## \uC124\uCE58\n\n<packageinstall />\n\n## \uC0AC\uC6A9\uBC95\n\n```tsx\n<dialog>\n  <dialogtrigger aschild>\n    <button>open dialog</button>\n  </dialogtrigger>\n  <dialogcontent>\n    <dialogheader>\n      <dialogtitle>confirm action</dialogtitle>\n      <dialogdescription>\n        are you sure you want to continue?\n      </dialogdescription>\n    </dialogheader>\n    <dialogclose aschild>\n      <button>cancel</button>\n    </dialogclose>\n  </dialogcontent>\n</dialog>\n\n<dialog size="sm" open={isopen} onopenchange={setisopen}>\n  <dialogcontent scrollable={false}>\n    {/* content with custom scroll handling */}\n  </dialogcontent>\n</dialog>\n```\n\n\uACC4\uC57D \uC18C\uC2A4: `packages/react/spec/components/dialog.json` \u2014 \uC704\uC758 specrenderer\uB85C \uB80C\uB354\uB9C1\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.\n'
